<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan banks and markets closed Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan banks and markets closed Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's banks and financial markets are closed Wednesday March 19 for the San Jose market holiday.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Thursday March 20.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2607)).</p>
</text>
